<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4758" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλφάνω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰν]</span> (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλφαίνω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>EM</u>
			72.39
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Aët.
			13.133
		</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i> only in aor. 2
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦλφον,</span> cf. <i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			1.53a15
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Plu.
			2.668c
		</span></i>: pres., <i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>Med.</u>
			297
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>Fr.</u>
			326
		</span></i> (no-where else in Trag.), <i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			324
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Eup.
			258
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Men.
			362
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bring in,
				yield, fetch,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵνα μοι βίοτον πολὺν ἄλφοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					17.250
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ δ᾽ ὑμῖν μυρίον ὦνον ἄλφοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					15.452
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				20.383
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκατόμβοιον δέ τοι ἦλφον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.79
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπόσην ἂν ἄλφῃ μίσθωσιν τὸ
				τέμενος</span>
			<u>IG</u> l.c., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
			</span></i> l.c.: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθόνον ἀλφάνειν</span>
			<i>to incur</i> envy, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				297
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναλλάσσω</span>
			, <i>change,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aët.
			</span></i> l.c. (cf. Skt. <i>arghás</i> 'price').</div>
